38207>>>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
38210>>>>>        // Ajusta los botones del selector según la vista desde la que se haya navegado.
38210>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
38211>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
38212>>>>>
38212>>>>>        Case Begin
38212>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
38214>>>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
38214>>>>>                Case Break
38215>>>>>
38215>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
38218>>>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
38218>>>>>                Case Break
38219>>>>>
38219>>>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
38222>>>>>                // If from main, this is a probably a main-file lookup from a Zoom
38222>>>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
38223>>>>>                Case Break
38224>>>>>
38224>>>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38224>>>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38224>>>>>
38224>>>>>        Case End
38224>>>>>
38224>>>>>    End_Procedure
38225>>>>>
38225>>>>>
38225>>>>>End_Object 
